Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  Monotone Bass Synthesizer
//
//  Pads      -> reserved (filter envelope templates below)
//  Knobs 1-4A-> voice & filter section      (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> amp envelope                (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y-> Mod Wheel
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerhead Software	se.propellerheads.Monotone
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	Amp	Filter
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"Monotone"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (reserved) ---------------------------------
// Monotone has no drum pads; ready-to-enable templates:
// Map Pad 1		Select Previous Patch
// Map Pad 2		Select Next Patch
// Map Pad 3		Filter Attack
// Map Pad 4		Filter Decay
// Map Pad 5		Filter Sustain
// Map Pad 6		Filter Release

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): voice & filter -----------
Map	Knob 1 A		Osc Mix
Map	Knob 2 A		Filter Freq
Map	Knob 3 A		Filter Reso
Map	Knob 4 A		Filter Vel

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): amp envelope -------------
Map	Knob 1 B		Amp Attack
Map	Knob 2 B		Amp Decay
Map	Knob 3 B		Amp Sustain
Map	Knob 4 B		Amp Release

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel